5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I need to see where the money actually goes before we promise anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"We must confirm who is actually available to work, not just who is on paper.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The data on what people actually enjoy is more important than our pride.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building itself has limits that we often ignore until it is too late.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the logistics that always seem to fail us at the door.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, do you have specific roles in mind that are currently vacant?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, the conservation and floor staff are stretched thin. I need to verify the roster.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, if the budget is tight, we should look at the transport costs too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, delivery issues are critical. We need to know where past seasons failed.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, exactly. I want to see the paperwork against the shipping cut-offs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look into the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster composition.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the lender paperwork and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,That covers my concerns. Let's see what the numbers say.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. The human element is often the most fragile part of the plan.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,The record will speak for itself. I trust the data over intuition.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The physical constraints are non-negotiable. We must respect the structure.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope we find a way to avoid the usual apologies at the entrance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
