35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport costs are shocking. Nearly a third of the installation budget!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is down to one person. The backlog is two hundred pieces.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"People come back for the live demonstrations, not the static cases.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The suspended bay can only hold four hundred kilos per square metre.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Two recent openings slipped because the paperwork arrived too late.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that weight limit is a huge problem for heavy loans.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, the volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle. They are busy.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, but the comment slips say people want to see someone working.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, yes. And the maintenance log shows seventeen call-outs last season.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the evening hires also damage open arrangements. We need to be careful.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If we choose something with heavy loans, the transport costs will be unbearable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,We cannot rely on the volunteers for daily operations. We need staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,We should prioritize an exhibition that allows for live interaction.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We must avoid anything that requires heavy rigging in the suspended bay.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We need to ensure the paperwork is handled well in advance.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards something that doesn't require expensive custom mounts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about the staffing for any complex installation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,The data supports an exhibition with moving parts or live elements.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The structural limits rule out heavy stonework or large models.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope we can find a balance between logistics and visitor experience.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
